<p style="text-align: left;">A plein air painting that I did earlier in the summer at Faraway Farm in Upperville, VA. &nbsp;I was standing right up against the fence at the edge of the field. close enough to fasten my shade umbrella to the fence. &nbsp;Like most of my plein air work this year, I kept this one to a small size and was able to finish it quickly.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Fields at Faraway Farm. &nbsp;Oil on linen, 6"x9". 2013.</p>